I've noticed that whereas in previous versions I could get to level 3
and sometimes (if I was patient enough) get to level 5 without getting
off the first level.  Now, with PL 6, I have to have a lot of patience 
just to get to level 3 on the first level.  

Is this part of the scheme to make the game easier?  If so, where does
it start getting harder to the point of being easier to gain levels using
some of the gross weapons I've been given?

I might not die on level 1, but it was fun being level 7 going onto level
3 of the dungeon...

Perhaps *three* levels of difficulty are needed..."easy", "medium" and "hard".
Just a thought.

